# Phase E Tier 2 WASM artifacts land here.
#
# Populated by the Dockerfile's `wasm-builder` stage (cargo build
# --target wasm32-unknown-unknown -p flashlight-analytics --lib +
# wasm-bindgen --target web --no-typescript). Output files are:
#
#   flashlight_analytics_bg.wasm    — the compiled WASM module
#   flashlight_analytics.js         — wasm-bindgen JS glue (ES module)
#
# Embedded into the flashlight binary via `rust-embed` and served by
# the `/api/wasm/*` route. Tier 1 page lazy-loads them when
# conditions allow (Phase E follow-on PR wires the boot logic).
#
# Local non-Docker builds: this folder is empty by default and the
# /api/wasm/* route 404s. To populate manually, from the repo root:
#
#   rustup target add wasm32-unknown-unknown
#   cargo install --locked wasm-bindgen-cli --version "^0.2"
#   cd crates
#   cargo build --release --target wasm32-unknown-unknown \
#       -p flashlight-analytics --lib
#   wasm-bindgen --target web --no-typescript \
#       --out-dir ../ops/flashlight/src/assets/wasm/ \
#       target/wasm32-unknown-unknown/release/flashlight_analytics.wasm
#
# The .gitignore for ops/flashlight/src/assets/wasm/ excludes
# everything except this .gitkeep so locally-built artifacts don't
# leak into commits.
